Tux, the Linux penguin, as published on Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tux.svg

Public domain (CC0): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Tux was originally made by Larry Ewing in the GIMP, re-illustrated in vector
by Garrett LeSage using Inkscape, and refined and cleaned up by IFo Hancroft:
https://github.com/garrett/Tux
